<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Document</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        h1, h2, h3, h4 { font-weight: bold; }
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        td, th { padding: 8px; text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; }
        .header-title { font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold; }
        .section-title { font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .sub-section-title { font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 5px; }
        .caption { font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 5px; text-align: center; }
        .footer { font-size: 8pt; text-align: center; margin-top: 20px; }
        .logo { position: absolute; bottom: 50px; right: 60px; font-size: 12pt; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <div class="header-title">Ersatzteilblatt SPL/FXE4000-DE43F-DE Rev. B</div>
        <h1 style="font-size: 20pt;">Magnetisch-induktiver Durchflussmesser</h1>
        <h1 style="font-size: 20pt;">FXE4000-DE43F</h1>
    </div>
    <div style="float: right; margin-top: 50px;">
        <!-- Placeholder for the main product image -->
        <img src="placeholder_product_image.png" alt="Product Image" style="width: 250px; height: auto;">
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <h2 style="font-size: 16pt;">Inhalt</h2>
    <table style="width: 100%;">
        <tr>
            <td style="width: 50%;">1 <span data-field="section_1_title">{{ section_1_title }}</span> ................. 3</td>
            <td style="width: 50%;">1.1 <span data-field="section_1_1_title">{{ section_1_1_title }}</span> ................. 3</td>
            <td style="width: 50%;">1.2 <span data-field="section_1_2_title">{{ section_1_2_title }}</span> ................. 3</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>2 <span data-field="section_2_title">{{ section_2_title }}</span> ................. 4</td>
            <td>3 <span data-field="section_3_title">{{ section_3_title }}</span> ................. 5</td>
            <td>4 <span data-field="section_4_title">{{ section_4_title }}</span> ................. 6</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>5 <span data-field="section_5_title">{{ section_5_title }}</span> ................. 6</td>
            <td>6 <span data-field="section_6_title">{{ section_6_title }}</span> ................. 7</td>
            <td>6.1 <span data-field="section_6_1_title">{{ section_6_1_title }}</span> ................. 7</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td></td>
            <td>6.2 <span data-field="section_6_2_title">{{ section_6_2_title }}</span> ................. 7</td>
        </tr>
    </table>
    <div class="footer">
        2 SPL/FXE4000-DE43F-DE Rev. B | FXE4000-DE43F
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <h2 style="font-size: 16pt;">1 Typenschildangaben für die Ersatzteilbestellung</h2>
    <p>Die Identifikation der Ausführung des Durchflussmessers erfolgt anhand des Typenschilds, welches auf dem Gehäuse angebracht ist.</p>

    <div class="sub-section-title">1.1 Typenschild bei Ausführung als Kompaktgerät</div>
    <p>Bei Ersatzteilbestellungen ist in jedem Fall die Auftragsnummer gemäß Typenschild anzugeben.</p>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-around; margin-top: 20px;">
        <!-- Placeholder for the compact device image -->
        <img src="placeholder_compact_device_image.png" alt="Compact Device" style="width: 40%;">
        <img src="placeholder_technical_plate_image.png" alt="Technical Plate" style="width: 40%;">
    </div>
    <p class="caption">Abb. 1: Typenschild bei Ausführung als Kompaktgerät</p>
    <p class="caption">1 Auftragsnummer</p>

    <div class="sub-section-title">1.2 Identifikation der Ausführungsvariante des Messumformers</div>
    <p>Die Identifikation der Messumformerausführung erfolgt anhand des Schildes am Metallrahmen des Messumformereinschubes.</p>
    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
        <!-- Placeholder for the flow meter insert image -->
        <img src="placeholder_flow_meter_insert_image.png" alt="Flow Meter Insert" style="width: 80%;">
    </div>
    <p class="caption">Abb. 2: Typenschild am Messumformereinschub</p>
    <p class="caption">1 Variante</p>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <h2 style="font-size: 16pt;">2 Überblick</h2>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-around; margin-top: 40px;">
        <!-- Image 1 -->
        <div style="text-align: center;">
            <img src="placeholder_image_1.png" alt="Component 1" style="width: 200px;">
            <p>1</p>
        </div>
        <!-- Image 2 -->
        <div style="text-align: center;">
            <img src="placeholder_image_2.png" alt="Component 2" style="width: 200px;">
            <p>2</p>
        </div>
        <!-- Image 3 -->
        <div style="text-align: center;">
            <img src="placeholder_image_3.png" alt="Component 3" style="width: 200px;">
            <p>3</p>
        </div>
        <!-- Image 4 -->
        <div style="text-align: center;">
            <img src="placeholder_image_4.png" alt="Component 4" style="width: 200px;">
            <p>4</p>
        </div>
        <!-- Image 5 -->
        <div style="text-align: center;">
            <img src="placeholder_image_5.png" alt="Component 5" style="width: 200px;">
            <p>5</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <p class="caption">Abb. 3: Übersicht FXE4000-DE43F</p>
    <p class="caption">1 Durchflussmesser | 2 Messumformergehäuse | 3 Messumformereinschub | 4 Leiterplatte | 5 Aufnehmsimulator</p>

    <div style="margin-top: 30px; padding: 15px; border: 1px solid #ccc;">
        <p style="font-weight: bold;">WICHTIG (HINWEIS)</p>
        <p>Ausführliche Informationen zur Bestellung des Messumformereinschubs und des Aufnehmsimulators sind den entsprechenden separaten Ersatzteilblättern zu entnehmen.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <h2 style="font-size: 16pt;">3 Messumformergehäuse</h2>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-around; margin-top: 40px;">
        <!-- Image 1 -->
        <div style="text-align: center;">
            <img src="placeholder_image_4_1.png" alt="Housing Image 1" style="width: 30%;">
            <p>1</p>
        </div>
        <!-- Image 2 -->
        <div style="text-align: center;">
            <img src="placeholder_image_4_2.png" alt="Housing Image 2" style="width: 30%;">
            <p>2</p>
        </div>
        <!-- Image 3 -->
        <div style="text-align: center;">
            <img src="placeholder_image_4_3.png" alt="Housing Image 3" style="width: 30%;">
            <p>3</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <p class="caption">Abb. 4</p>

    <h3 style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 30px;">Gehäuse vormontiert NPT 1/2"</h3>
    <table>
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th style="width: 10%;">Position</th>
                <th style="width: 35%;">Benennung</th>
                <th style="width: 20%;">Variante</th>
                <th style="width: 15%;">Bestellnummer</th>
                <th style="width: 10%;">Gewicht kg (lb)</th>
                <th style="width: 10%;">Preis (€)</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            {% for item in housing_parts %}
            <tr>
                <td>{{ loop.index }}</td>
                <td><span data-field="housing_parts[{{ loop.index0 }}].description">{{ item.description }}</span></td>
                <td>{{ item.variant }}</td>
                <td>{{ item.order_number }}</td>
                <td>{{ item.weight }}</td>
                <td>{{ item.price }}</td>
            </tr>
            {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
    </table>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <h2 style="font-size: 16pt;">4 Messumformereinschub</h2>
    <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
        <!-- Image 1 -->
        <img src="placeholder_image_5_1.png" alt="Insert Image 1" style="width: 60%;">
        <!-- Image 2 -->
        <img src="placeholder_image_5_2.png" alt="Insert Image 2" style="width: 35%;">
    </div>
    <p class="caption">Abb. 5</p>

    <table>
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th style="width: 10%;">Position</th>
                <th style="width: 40%;">Benennung</th>
                <th style="width: 20%;">Variante</th>
                <th style="width: 15%;">Bestellnummer</th>
                <th style="width: 15%;">Preis (€)</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            {% for item in insert_parts %}
            <tr>
                <td>{{ loop.index }}</td>
                <td><span data-field="insert_parts[{{ loop.index0 }}].description">{{ item.description }}</span></td>
                <td>{{ item.variant }}</td>
                <td>{{ item.order_number }}</td>
                <td>{{ item.price }}</td>
            </tr>
            {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
    </table>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <h2 style="font-size: 16pt;">5 Zubehör</h2>
    <table>
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th style="width: 10%;">Position</th>
                <th style="width: 40%;">Benennung</th>
                <th style="width: 20%;">Bestellnummer</th>
                <th style="width: 15%;">Gewicht kg (lb)</th>
                <th style="width: 15%;">Preis (€)</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            {% for item in accessories %}
            <tr>
                <td>{{ loop.index }}</td>
                <td><span data-field="accessories[{{ loop.index0 }}].description">{{ item.description }}</span></td>
                <td>{{ item.order_number }}</td>
                <td>{{ item.weight }}</td>
                <td>{{ item.price }}</td>
            </tr>
            {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
    </table>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <h2 style="font-size: 16pt;">6 Dichtungen für Schweißstutzen Serie FXE4000</h2>

    <h3 style="font-size: 12pt;">6.1 Flachdichtungen (neu gemäß DGRL)</h3>
    <table>
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th style="width: 10%;">Position</th>
                <th style="width: 40%;">Benennung</th>
                <th style="width: 20%;">Nennweite</th>
                <th style="width: 20%;">Bestellnummer</th>
                <th style="width: 10%;">Gewicht kg (lb)</th>
                <th style="width: 10%;">Preis (€)</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            {% for item in flat_gaskets %}
            <tr>
                <td>{{ loop.index }}</td>
                <td><span data-field="flat_gaskets[{{ loop.index0 }}].description">{{ item.description }}</span></td>
                <td>{{ item.nominal_size }}</td>
                <td>{{ item.order_number }}</td>
                <td>{{ item.weight }}</td>
                <td>{{ item.price }}</td>
            </tr>
            {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h3 style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 30px;">6.2 O-Ring-Dichtungen (alt)</h3>
    <table>
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th style="width: 10%;">Position</th>
                <th style="width: 40%;">Benennung</th>
                <th style="width: 20%;">Nennweite</th>
                <th style="width: 20%;">Bestellnummer</th>
                <th style="width: 10%;">Gewicht kg (lb)</th>
                <th style="width: 10%;">Preis (€)</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            {% for item in o_ring_gaskets %}
            <tr>
                <td>{{ loop.index }}</td>
                <td><span data-field="o_ring_gaskets[{{ loop.index0 }}].description">{{ item.description }}</span></td>
                <td>{{ item.nominal_size }}</td>
                <td>{{ item.order_number }}</td>
                <td>{{ item.weight }}</td>
                <td>{{ item.price }}</td>
            </tr>
            {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
    </table>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <h2 style="font-size: 16pt;">Kontakt</h2>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 40px;">
        <div style="width: 50%;">
            <p>Ihre lokale ABB-Niederlassung finden Sie unter:</p>
            <p>www.abb.com/contacts</p>
            <p>Weitere Produktinformationen finden Sie unter:</p>
            <p>www.abb.com</p>
            <p><strong>ABB Automation GmbH</strong></p>
            <p>Service Instrumentierung</p>
            <p><span data-field="address_street">{{ address_street }}</span></p>
            <p><span data-field="address_city">{{ address_city }}</span></p>
            <p><span data-field="address_zip_code">{{ address_zip_code }}</span></p>
            <p>Tel: <span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span></p>
            <p>Fax: <span data-field="fax_number">{{ fax_number }}</span></p>
            <p>parts-repair-goettingen@de.abb.com</p>
        </div>
        <div style="width: 45%; text-align: right;">
            <p>Hinweis</p>
            <p>Technische Änderungen sowie Inhaltsänderungen dieses Dokuments behalten wir uns jederzeit ohne Vorankündigung vor.</p>
            <p>Bei Bestellungen gelten die vereinbarten Lieferbedingungen. ABB übernimmt keinerlei Haftung für eventuelle Fehler oder Unvollständigkeiten in diesem Dokument.</p>
            <p>Wir behalten uns alle Rechte an diesem Dokument vor. Jegliche Vervielfältigung, Verbreitung oder Bearbeitung ohne schriftliche Zustimmung von ABB ist untersagt.</p>
            <p>Copyright © 2013 ABB</p>
            <p>Alle Rechte vorbehalten</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
        FXE4000-DE43F | SPL/FXE4000-DE43F-DE Rev. B 7
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>